WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:03.625
- [Shanahan:] Four years ago, I had Patty Mahomes on the ropes.

00:00:03.708 --> 00:00:05.708
Back then, if I had the lead in the Big Game...

00:00:05.708 --> 00:00:06.458
Check.

00:00:06.458 --> 00:00:08.083
[Shanahan:] I simply stopped trying to score.

00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:12.083
- Ummm, are Aces good?

00:00:12.083 --> 00:00:13.708
- I... I fold.

00:00:13.708 --> 00:00:14.875
- Yay!

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.500
- We will be back here with a vengeance.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.750
- [Shanahan:] A lot can change in four years.

00:00:22.458 --> 00:00:24.500
Chiefs went from lovable underdogs...

00:00:25.208 --> 00:00:28.333
...to taking over the house that ALWAYS wins.

00:00:28.458 --> 00:00:31.500
- Putting together a team to take back
what's ours.

00:00:31.708 --> 00:00:32.958
- RIGHT ON, BROTHER.

00:00:32.958 --> 00:00:34.208
- Oh, not like that.

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:36.500
[Shanahan:] Deebo, you play slot, and stay in motion.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:40.208
And Kittle will be secretly mic'ed up so he can quietly let us know what's going on.

00:00:40.458 --> 00:00:44.500
- Okay, so we've snuck into enemy territory,
but I don't think they suspect anything.

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:47.375
- [Shanahan:] CMC, we'll need you to go on a big run.

00:00:47.375 --> 00:00:49.458
- I have 25 6s!

00:00:49.583 --> 00:00:51.708
- [Shanahan:] Then you all put pressure on him.

00:00:52.083 --> 00:00:53.500
- I wouldn't do that if I were you.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:54.750
It's against the law.

00:00:54.958 --> 00:00:55.833
- What law?

00:00:55.833 --> 00:00:57.208
- The Greenlaw.

00:00:57.708 --> 00:00:58.583
- There's too much heat on us.

00:00:58.583 --> 00:01:01.208
We need someone they won't expect. A real nobody.

00:01:01.208 --> 00:01:03.125
Someone...irrelevant.

00:01:03.125 --> 00:01:04.958
- I know just the guy.

00:01:06.083 --> 00:01:06.958
- Purdy, isn’t it?

00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:08.875
It's the man! Scramble!

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.083
- How'd you like to make a lot of money?

00:01:11.083 --> 00:01:12.708
Well, league minimum.

00:01:12.708 --> 00:01:14.208
You son of a coach.

00:01:14.208 --> 00:01:14.583
I’m in.

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:15.875
- [Shanahan:] We had to be careful.

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:18.250
They'd shored up their defense
over the years.

00:01:19.208 --> 00:01:21.208
And she was always watching.

00:01:22.333 --> 00:01:24.875
But while they were distracted,
Purdy scampered in.

00:01:25.083 --> 00:01:25.958
- Pa-check.

00:01:25.958 --> 00:01:26.833
- Juszczyk.

00:01:26.833 --> 00:01:27.500
- Pa-check.

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:28.500
- No, JUS-zczyk.

00:01:29.208 --> 00:01:31.750
- Lucky ol' Brock Purdy must have just gotten dealt a good hand.

00:01:33.833 --> 00:01:35.708
- Pay that man his money.

00:01:35.708 --> 00:01:38.083
Like, y’all should really extend him.

00:01:38.208 --> 00:01:41.625
- [Shanahan:] But could he go head to head with
Patty MVP?

00:01:43.458 --> 00:01:44.708
In the Big Game,

00:01:44.708 --> 00:01:47.125
you can only play it safe for so long.

00:01:48.833 --> 00:01:50.250
- I'm going for it.

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:51.958
- Not so fast, Chief.

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:54.208
I call.

00:01:56.375 --> 00:01:58.125
- You don't have to call.

00:01:58.125 --> 00:02:00.333
- [Announcer:] Rejoice Millennials, it's USHER!

00:02:05.041 --> 00:02:07.750
- You know, they wouldn't even be in that game if it weren't for us.

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:10.250
- Also, everyone likes to pretend it's Mahomes vs. Purdy.

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:12.041
They literally never play at the same
time.

00:02:12.041 --> 00:02:14.125
- Right? We're the ones facing Purdy.

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:15.791
Wait, shhh.

00:02:15.791 --> 00:02:17.458
SHE's watching.

